- Add a new plan document for shipping the vox-mental-tracker app on web, iOS, and Android.
- The plan outlines six independently shippable tracks:
    - A. Codegen correctness (async/await)
    - B. GUI guardrails (five compile-time guardrails)
    - C. Typed forms (first-class typed forms)
    - D. Mobile primitives (lifting Capacitor wiring into the language)
    - E. Mental-tracker mobile productionization (icons, signing, store, offline)
    - F. Test infrastructure (E2E, unit, snapshot tests)
- The plan details the tech stack including Rust 2024, TypeScript + React 19, TanStack Router 6, Tailwind 3, Capacitor 6, Kotlin, Swift, Playwright, Vitest, and `insta`.

